# Committed PDFs are build artifacts rendered by Chrome. Git's content
# auto-detection already keeps them out of EOL conversion, but this repo ships
# several of them and is worked on from Windows, where a stray core.autocrlf
# would corrupt them silently. Declare it rather than rely on the heuristic.
*.pdf binary

# Same reasoning for the narration audio: several megabytes of MP3 per post,
# committed, and worked on from Windows where a stray core.autocrlf would
# corrupt them silently.
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
